// Muestras de color en una fila de grupo (acento de Windows y acento de la app).
// Animaciones y efectos en hijos, nunca en la raíz (ver basics.slint).

import { Theme } from "../theme.slint";

export component Swatch {
    in property <color> tone;
    in property <bool> selected;
    in property <string> label;
    // Se dibuja como vidrio teñido (reflejo arriba, sombra al pie) en vez de
    // un color plano: es la muestra del acento "Vidrio líquido".
    in property <bool> glass: false;
    callback clicked();

    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    accessible-role: button;
    accessible-label: root.label;
    accessible-checked: root.selected;
    accessible-action-default => { root.clicked(); }

    Rectangle {
        border-radius: 10px;
        // Vidrio: celeste translúcido con reflejo y borde claro, sin el color
        // sólido de las otras muestras.
        background: !root.glass ? root.tone : @linear-gradient(180deg,
            rgba(255, 255, 255, Theme.dark ? 0.55 : 0.90) 0%,
            root.tone.with-alpha(0.70) 48%,
            root.tone.with-alpha(0.38) 100%);
        border-width: root.glass ? 1px : 0.5px;
        border-color: root.glass ? rgba(255, 255, 255, Theme.dark ? 0.55 : 0.85) : #00000033;
        transform-scale-x: touch.pressed ? 0.82 : touch.has-hover ? 1.15 : 1;
        transform-scale-y: touch.pressed ? 0.82 : touch.has-hover ? 1.15 : 1;
        animate transform-scale-x, transform-scale-y { duration: Theme.quick; easing: cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1); }
        if root.glass: Rectangle {
            x: 4px;
            y: 2px;
            width: 10px;
            height: 4px;
            border-radius: 2px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
        }
        if root.selected: Rectangle {
            x: -3.5px;
            y: -3.5px;
            width: 27px;
            height: 27px;
            border-radius: 13.5px;
            border-width: 1.5px;
            border-color: root.tone;
        }
        if root.selected: Rectangle {
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            border-radius: 3.5px;
            background: #ffffff;
        }
    }
    touch := TouchArea {
        mouse-cursor: pointer;
        clicked => { root.clicked(); }
    }
}

// Fila con título, subtítulo y muestras de color a la derecha.
export component SwatchRow inherits Rectangle {
    in property <string> label;
    in property <string> sub;
    in property <bool> first: false;
    in property <bool> highlighted: false;
    in property <bool> enabled: true;
    in property <[color]> colors;
    in property <[string]> labels;
    // -1 = ninguna elegida
    in property <int> selected: -1;
    // Índice que se dibuja como vidrio en vez de color plano (-1 = ninguno).
    in property <int> glass-index: -1;
    callback activated(int);

    min-height: root.sub != "" ? 50px : 40px;
    accessible-role: list-item;
    accessible-label: root.label;

    Rectangle {
        background: root.highlighted ? Theme.accent.with-alpha(0.18) : transparent;
        animate background { duration: Theme.quick; }
    }
    HorizontalLayout {
        padding-left: 10px;
        padding-right: 12px;
        padding-top: 6px;
        padding-bottom: 6px;
        spacing: 10px;
        VerticalLayout {
            alignment: center;
            spacing: 2px;
            horizontal-stretch: 1;
            Text {
                text: root.label;
                color: root.enabled ? Theme.label : Theme.label3;
                font-size: 13px;
                overflow: elide;
            }
            if root.sub != "": Text {
                text: root.sub;
                color: Theme.label2;
                font-size: 11px;
                wrap: word-wrap;
            }
        }
        HorizontalLayout {
            spacing: 9px;
            alignment: end;
            for tone[i] in root.colors: VerticalLayout {
                alignment: center;
                Swatch {
                    tone: tone;
                    selected: i == root.selected;
                    glass: i == root.glass-index;
                    label: i < root.labels.length ? root.labels[i] : "";
                    clicked => {
                        if root.enabled {
                            root.activated(i);
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
    if !root.first: Rectangle {
        x: 10px;
        y: 0px;
        width: parent.width - 20px;
        height: 1px;
        background: Theme.separator;
    }
}
